# No free-roam streetcars during a Muni Race but its own car: run muni j takes them away (the race runs
# as in sf-muni-j-lose), and run free brings them back, as they were at the start (sf-streetcars: the
# same stops 8500 ticks later).
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 streetcars on
cmd 10 run muni j
cmd 8500 run free
run 12500
expect event muniStart{line=j,car=83} within 11..11
expect no event tramStop within 1..8500
expect event muniOver{won=false} within 7905..7905
expect event tramStop{car=1000001,line=j-out,n=1} within 10423..10423
expect event tramStop{car=1000000,line=j-in,n=2} within 12028..12028
